<main id="main">

  <section class="page-head wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">
      <a href="/services" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none">Services</a>
    </p>

    <h1>On-demand Therapy</h1>

    <p class="lede">Flexible access to a licensed therapist when you need support, with same day phone sessions available throughout Colorado.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="banner banner--pines" role="img" aria-label="A quiet stand of Colorado pines"></div>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap narrow">

      <div class="framed service" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:3rem">
        <div class="price">$500/month</div>
        <p class="meta">Flexible same day therapy by phone</p>
        <a class="btn btn--solid" href="/contact">Schedule a consultation</a>
      </div>

      <p>Life does not schedule itself around your therapy appointment. A difficult conversation, a craving, a loss, a major decision, or feeling overwhelmed can happen on Wednesday even if your next session is not until the following Monday. On-demand therapy is built around the simple idea that support should be available closer to the moment you actually need it.</p>

      <p>Instead of relying on a single standing appointment each week, this service gives you more flexible access to a therapist throughout the month. When something comes up, you can request a same day conversation by phone during available support hours. That might mean working through something significant, getting perspective before making a decision, or talking through a difficult moment while it is still happening.</p>

      <p>This is still therapy, not a crisis line or emergency service. The difference is access. Rather than saving everything for your next appointment, we can work with problems closer to when they occur, and we can turn those conversations into practical next steps.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top:2.5rem">Who this is for</h2>
      <ul class="ticks">
        <li>People who want more support than a traditional weekly therapy appointment provides</li>
        <li>People navigating a stressful, uncertain, or rapidly changing period of life</li>
        <li>People in recovery who may benefit from support when cravings, setbacks, or difficult situations arise</li>
        <li>People dealing with grief, relationship problems, anxiety, anger, or difficult decisions that do not always wait for the next scheduled session</li>
        <li>People who value having an established therapist they can reach when they actually need to talk</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="margin-top:2.5rem">What to expect</h2>
      <ul class="ticks">
        <li>A free consultation before you commit to the service</li>
        <li>Flexible access to request same day therapy during available support hours</li>
        <li>On demand sessions by phone, with secure video sessions available when scheduled in advance</li>
        <li>Conversations that can range from a brief check in to a full therapy session, depending on what you need</li>
        <li>Direct feedback, practical support, and goals that we develop together</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="margin-top:2.5rem">How the membership works</h2>
      <ul class="ticks">
        <li>$500 per month includes up to four hours of clinical support</li>
        <li>Use your time when you need it, from brief check ins to longer therapy sessions</li>
        <li>Time is billed in 15 minute increments, with a 15 minute minimum</li>
        <li>On demand support is available by phone from 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM, seven days a week</li>
        <li>Video sessions are available when scheduled in advance</li>
        <li>Same day response is included, and I will often be able to connect within the same hour when my schedule allows</li>
        <li>Unused hours expire at the end of each month and do not roll over</li>
      </ul>

      <p>On demand does not mean that I will always be immediately available. I work with other clients and have responsibilities that may occasionally prevent an immediate response. When you reach out during available hours, I will make every effort to connect with you as soon as possible that day.</p>

      <p>Clients must be physically located in Colorado at the time services are provided. For privacy and safety, you should also be in a private, stationary location where you can speak freely and safely participate in the call.</p>

      <p class="callout" style="margin-top:2.5rem">
        On-demand therapy is available to clients located in Colorado. It is not a crisis or emergency service.
        <a href="/services">See all services and payment options &rarr;</a>
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="contact-form">
    <div class="wrap center">
      <h2>Book a consultation</h2>

      <p class="narrow">Free, confidential, and no obligation to schedule.</p>

      <form class="form" id="contactForm" style="margin-top:2.5rem" method="post" action="/api/contact" novalidate>

        <div class="form__row">
          <label class="sr-only" for="cf-name">Name</label>
          <input id="cf-name" type="text" name="name" placeholder="Name" autocomplete="name" required>

          <label class="sr-only" for="cf-email">Email address</label>
          <input id="cf-email" type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email Address" autocomplete="email" required>
        </div>

        <label class="sr-only" for="cf-phone">Phone number (optional)</label>
        <input id="cf-phone" type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="Phone (optional)" autocomplete="tel">

        <label class="sr-only" for="cf-message">Message</label>
        <textarea id="cf-message" name="message" placeholder="What brings you here? A sentence or two is plenty." required></textarea>

        <div class="hp" aria-hidden="true">
          <label>Company<input type="text" name="company" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label>
        </div>

        <button class="btn btn--terracotta" type="submit" data-label="Send">Send</button>

        <p class="form__status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>

        <p class="form__note">
          Your privacy and safety are my top concerns. Your information will never be shared or sold.
          Please don't include sensitive clinical details in this form &mdash; we'll cover those securely
          once we connect.
        </p>

      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<div class="photostrip photostrip--valley" role="img" aria-label="A green alpine valley in the Colorado Rockies"></div>

